# Per-Dockerfile ignore for docker/Dockerfile.terminal (G5). BuildKit selects this file,
# named after the Dockerfile's own basename and placed next to it, over the root
# .dockerignore for THIS build only — the root .dockerignore's `tests/` exclusion
# exists for the (unrelated) MCP image and must not block the `tests` target here.
# Everything else stays denied by default via the allowlist below, mirroring
# C0_CONTAINER_DESIGN.md §4.2's intent.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!lab/
!dashboard/
!canonical/
!automation/
!docker/
!tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.jsonl
**/*.pickle
**/*token*.json
**/*session*.json
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
.pytest_cache/
